    "chunk_text": "m\u00e6ge befleon. \u00deeah se mon eardige on middum burgum & on middan his m\u00e6g\u00fee betweoh hundteontigum \u00feusenda & se dea\u00fe is iunglic, for \u00feon \u00fee cild swelta\u00fe & unmagan, & he is freolic & \u00feeowlic, for \u00feon cyningas \u00de\u00e6t is wel wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he sy unrot \u00fe\u00e6m synfullum for \u00fe\u00e6m him n\u00e6fre \u00e6fter ne cuma\u00fe ne beforan ne & se dea\u00f0 bi\u00f0 bli\u00f0e halgum mannum for \u00feon gesceade wi\u00f0 eor\u00fewelum, \u00fee him \u00e6r w\u00e6ron fr\u00e6mde on \u00deonne eal monna cyn ne m\u00e6g wordum as\u00e6cgan ne ariman \u00fe\u00e6s dea\u00fees gryre for \u00fe\u00e6m gedalum \u00fee on \u00de\u00e6t \u00e6ryste gescead bi\u00f0 lichomon & saule. \u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 sy\u00fe\u00f0an uncu\u00fe hw\u00e6\u00feer seo saul gemete\u00fe swa god swa yfel, swa hire gegearwod bi\u00f0 & hire For \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6ghwylcum bi\u00f0 sundorstow geteod \u00fea \u00f0e he him selfa \u00e6r geworhte. \u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feridde gescead wi\u00f0 eallum eor\u00feweolum. Ac se dea\u00fe bi\u00f0 egeslic for \u00fe\u00e6re biternesse, for \u00feon he betyne\u00fe \u00fea eagan from gesih\u00fee & \u00fea earan from Eala, wa \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee his ende \u00feyllic sceal beon. \u00deonne syndon fif hella onlicnessa her on worulde leornode on bocum. An is worc noma, for \u00feon an is micel cwealm \u00fee hine tosceade\u00fe & afylle\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t him sy\u00fe\u00f0an ne lyste\u00fe ne \u00deonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6fteran helle onlicnesse her",
